{"turn_id": "d27-t1", "session_id": "d27", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "data_source_platform", "text": "该论文使用的未标注文本来自中国的 Sina Weibo（新浪微博）服务。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-014d25fff447b24d4e5aae00"}]}, {"key": "data_source_reference", "text": "论文的标注语料是参照 Peng and Dredze (peng-dredze:2016:P16-2) 修改而来，未标注文本也与其相同，均来自 Sina Weibo，并使用中文分词系统 Jieba 进行分词。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-014d25fff447b24d4e5aae00"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d27-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d27-t2", "session_id": "d27", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "data_platform", "text": "论文使用与 Peng and Dredze (peng-dredze:2016:P16-2) 相同的未标注文本，该文本来自中国的 Sina Weibo 服务。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-014d25fff447b24d4e5aae00"}]}, {"key": "segmentation_tool", "text": "该未标注文本由中文分词系统 Jieba 进行分词，做法与 Peng and Dredze 相同，以便结果更具可比性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-014d25fff447b24d4e5aae00"}]}, {"key": "labelled_corpus", "text": "论文使用的是与 Peng and Dredze 相同的修改版标注语料（modified labelled corpus）用于中文社交媒体 NER，数据细节列于 Table TABREF19。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-014d25fff447b24d4e5aae00"}]}, {"key": "unlabeled_vs_labelled", "text": "论文指出存在大量未标注文本和相当有限的标注语料（massive unlabeled text and quite limited labelled corpus）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-9a8e2c5a1623ba6a00cddbb9"}]}, {"key": "positional_embeddings", "text": "作者比较了两种引入分词信息的方法，认为 positional character embeddings 在神经网络中表现更好，可能因为该方法能从无标注文本中学习分词信息，而分词只能使用训练语料。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1611.04234", "chunk_id": "c-2ecfa49d168250a1345fa6af"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d27-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
